 "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 673}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "Deep vein thrombosis is asymptomatic sometimes …………………", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 751}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "Compression therapy reduces the caliber of the superficial veins in the leg\n…………………", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 812}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "The importance of keeping legs elevated …………………", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 908}, {"number": 7, "prompt": "The nursing interventions …………………", "sourcePage": 4, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 962}, {"number": 8, "prompt": "What is the route of administration of heparin?\n………………………………….", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 188}, {"number": 9, "prompt": "In which part of the body DVT normally occurs?\n……………………………………..", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 264}, {"number": 10, "prompt": "When vena cava filler is used?\n……………………………..", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 342}, {"number": 11, "prompt": "Which management is preferred for DVT if anticoagulant or thrombolytic\ntherapy is contraindicated?\n………………………………", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 401}, {"number": 12, "prompt": "Which is the term used to describe the massive iliofemoral venous\nthrombosis?\n……………………………….", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 533}, {"number": 13, "prompt": "Which symptom usually occurs late in DVT?\n………………………………", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 645}, {"number": 14, "prompt": "DVT is a part of a condition called?\n…………………………………", "sourcePage": 5, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 714}, {"number": 15, "prompt": "A major problem is associated with recognizing DVT is that the signs and\nsymptoms are ………………………………….", "sourcePage": 6, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 196}, {"number": 16, "prompt": "Tenderness which usually occurs later is produced by……………….of the\nvein wall", "sourcePage": 6, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 310}, {"number": 17, "prompt": "In some cases, signs and symptoms of a …………are the first indication.", "sourcePage": 6, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 399}, {"number": 18, "prompt": "First PPT check is ……………… hours after starting infusion.", "sourcePage": 6, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 475}, {"number": 20, "prompt": "The patient should be aware of periodic blood tests which are necessary to\ndetermine if a change in ………………… or dosage is required.", "sourcePage": 6, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 607}], "skills": ["reading"], "recordings": [], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-f9bd3388dac0f977fc57", "filename": "Reading 26.pdf", "sha256": "f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper", "pages": [22, 23]}], "passages": []}, {"id": "f9bd3388dac0f977-p7", "label": "Part B · Reading 26.pdf", "part": "B", "sourceSha256": "f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9", "pages": [7, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12], "questions": [{"number": 3, "prompt": "Implantable Cardioverter Defibrillator (ICD)?\nAn ICD is a battery-powered device placed under the skin that keeps track of your\nheart rate. Thin wires connect the ICD to your heart. If an abnormal heart rhythm is\ndetected the device will deliver an electric shock to restore a normal heartbeat if\nyour heart is beating chaotically and much too fast. ICDs have been very useful in\npreventing sudden death in patients with known, sustained ventricular tachycardia\nor fibrillation. Studies have shown that they may have a role in preventing cardiac\narrest in high-risk patients who haven't had, but are at risk for, life-threatening\nventricular arrhythmias.", "sourcePage": 9, "choices": [], "kind": "question", "offset": 154, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-f9bd3388dac0f977fc57", "filename": "Reading 26.pdf", "sha256": "f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, "page": 23}}], "skills": ["reading"], "recordings": [], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-f9bd3388dac0f977fc57", "filename": "Reading 26.pdf", "sha256": "f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper", "pages": [22, 23]}], "passages": []}, {"id": "f9bd3388dac0f977-p13", "label": "Part C · Reading 26.pdf", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9", "pages": [13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19, 20, 21], "questions": [{"number": 14, "prompt": "“It does not mean you are risk free” in paragraph 8 refers to?\nA. there is a greater chance of infection in some areas even though there is no\nrecent report of infection\nB. even thought there are no current reported cases of yellow fever in some areas,\nthere is still a risk of getting injection\nC. it is always recommended to take vaccines before travelling to Africa and South\nAmerica\nD. local population is not affected by yellow fever because of vaccination", "sourcePage": 17, "choices": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "kind": "question", "offset": 252, "answer": {"text": "B", "source": {"id": "offline-f9bd3388dac0f977fc57", "filename": "Reading 26.pdf", "sha256": "f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, "page": 23}}], "skills": ["reading"], "recordings": [], "answerSources": [{"id": "offline-f9bd3388dac0f977fc57", "filename": "Reading 26.pdf", "sha256": "f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-2/f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/f9bd3388dac0f977fc5762068ae94d4fff601d9bf09c19f405d4116379a8f7f9.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper", "pages": [22, 23]}], "passages": []}]}
